    "description": {
      "value": "<p>You evoke the terrifying majesty of the Progenitor Wyrms. Radiant dragonshard wings erupt from your back and your skin hardens into crystalline scales. You gain a fly Speed equal to your Speed, resistance 5 to physical damage, and a +2 status bonus to Intimidation checks.</p><p>Once during the spell's duration, you can spend a single action to unleash a Progenitor Breath in a 30-foot cone, dealing 8d6 damage of the type associated with your bloodline patron (force or electricity for Siberys, fire or bludgeoning for Eberron, cold or void for Khyber; basic Reflex save).</p><p><strong>Heightened (+1):</strong> The physical resistance increases by 1, and the breath weapon damage increases by 2d6.</p>"
